# Copilot instructions

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root first; it is the shared rule file for every agent. Its "everlast" section says when to read `ai-docs/INDEX.md` and `ai-docs/HANDOFF.md` and when to record what a session learned (the everlast-capture skill under `~/.agents/skills/`, or `everlast.py note` / `handoff`). Anything naming a person, an internal host, a credential, or an opinion about people is written `--private`, never into this repository.
